{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e05-scene-03",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "狭い業界なんだから  (It's a Small Industry)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "reika": "麗華",
    "shacho": "社長"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a glittering reception celebrating the satellite channel's launch, the satellite company President warns Muranishi he will cancel the channel at the slightest misstep, while a longtime female staff director packs her boxes at the studio.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "日本のポルノ業界をけん引する作品を中心に放送してまいります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "shacho",
      "t": "どんな番組流すか知らないけどな、これからは会長も関係ない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "shacho",
      "t": "何かあったらすぐに打ち切りだぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろん望むところです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "さあ、それではいきますよ！テイクオフでございます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "大げさなんだよ。狭い業界なんだから、またすぐ会えるって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "困ったら連絡して。ギャラ安くても手伝いに行くから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "出世してよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ほら、でかい体してウジウジしない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ありがとうございました。みんな頑張ってね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "村西さん、これまでお世話になりました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、元気でな。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "日本のポルノ業界をけん引する作品を中心に放送してまいります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will broadcast programming centered on works that lead Japan's adult video industry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "shacho",
      "t": "どんな番組流すか知らないけどな、これからは会長も関係ない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't know what shows you'll air, but from here on the chairman won't shield you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "shacho",
      "t": "何かあったらすぐに打ち切りだぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If anything goes wrong, we cancel your broadcast immediately.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もちろん望むところです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course—I wouldn't have it any other way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "さあ、それではいきますよ！テイクオフでございます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, here we go! We have liftoff!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "大げさなんだよ。狭い業界なんだから、またすぐ会えるって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're making too big a deal of it. It's a small industry—we'll run into each other again soon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "困ったら連絡して。ギャラ安くても手伝いに行くから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Call me if you ever get into trouble. Even if the pay is low, I'll come help on your set.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "出世してよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Make sure you move up in the world.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ほら、でかい体してウジウジしない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, don't mope around with a big frame like yours.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "ありがとうございました。みんな頑張ってね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for everything. Keep giving it your best, everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "村西さん、これまでお世話になりました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Muranishi, thank you for everything up until now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、元気でな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah—take care of yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "日本のポルノ業界をけん引する作品を中心に放送してまいります。",
